                                      "Description of the characteristics of each group at inclusion, specifying the criteria used to distinguish them (e.g. type of exposure, clinical, socio-demographic or contextual characteristics)."@en ;
                       dc:identifier "E-080"^^xsd:anyURI ;
                       dc:title "Description du groupe"@fr ,
                                "Group description"@en .


